      "body": "\n\n## Overview\n\nFix loading sharded checkpoints from Hugging Face repository IDs. `load_weights()` previously treated the repository ID as a local path, causing shard lookup to fail.\n\n## Claims\n\n- Support HF repository IDs supplied through either `model` or `model_weights`.\n- Honor the configured revision, download directory, and ignore patterns.\n- Preserve existing handling for local directories and S3 paths.\n\n## Validation\n\nAdded one parameterized regression test covering local checkpoints, HF repository IDs, and `model_weights` overrides. It uses real safetensors weights and mocks HF downloads and distributed parallel-state accessors.\n\n- New regression cases before the fix: **2 failed, 1 passed**.\n- Selected CPU tests after the fix, including all three regression cases: **28 passed, 6 deselected**.\n- All applicable pre-commit hooks passed.\n\n```bash\n.venv/bin/python -m pytest \\\n  --confcutdir=tests/model_executor/model_loader \\\n  tests/model_executor/model_loader/test_sharded_state_loader.py \\\n  -k 'filter_subtensors or default_pattern or save_model or resolves_checkpoint_path' -q\n\npre-commit run --files \\\n  vllm/model_executor/model_loader/sharded_state_loader.py \\\n  tests/model_executor/model_loader/test_sharded_state_loader.py\n```\n\nFull GPU integration, live HF downloads, and the RunAI backend were not tested locally.\n\n## Details\n\nResolve the selected weight source using the existing `_prepare_weights()` method before searching for shard files. This converts HF repository IDs into local snapshot paths while retaining the existing handling for local directories and S3 paths.\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>Pull Request Checklist</summary>\n\n- [x] I used vLLM's `/pr-checklist` skill. (Mandatory for agents, optional for humans).\n- [x] AI assistance was used during the creation of this PR.\n\n- [x] **Design Fit:** Reuses the existing weight resolver without introducing new helpers or dependencies.\n- [ ] **Testing and Validation:** CPU regression tests pass; full end-to-end validation remains outstanding.\n- [x] **Code Quality and Style:** All applicable pre-commit checks passed.\n- [x] **Pull Request Contents:** Includes the root cause, fix, regression tests, and validation limitations.\n\n</details>",
